sequenceDiagram
 participant V as "현재 risk producer"
 participant P as "F023 FeedbackPolicy"
 participant A as "F024/025 Actuator"
 participant F as "AudioFocus"
 participant T as "Android TTS"
 participant S as "F032 진단 store"
 V->>P: "원본 capture·finite lease·severity"
 P->>P: "confidence·stability·priority·cooldown 검사"
 P-->>A: "exact delivery owner와 start deadline"
 A->>A: "현재 output gate·replacement 권한 확인"
 A->>S: "REQUESTED event enqueue, caller I/O 없음"
 A->>F: "current reservation으로 focus 요청"
 F-->>A: "grant/deny callback"
 alt "grant 및 owner 여전히 현재"
  A->>A: "validator 재검사"
  A->>T: "speak"
  T-->>A: "onStart(engine,id)"
  A->>A: "원본 lease/currentness 재검사·completion watchdog 시작"
  T-->>A: "onDone(engine,id)"
  A-->>P: "exact owner DONE"
  P->>P: "완료시각에 cooldown 확정"
 else "denied·stale·cancelled·실패"
  A-->>P: "exact rejection/cancel/failure"
  P->>P: "그 예약만 rollback"
 end
 Note over A,T: "old engine·old focus·old cancellation은 새 utterance를 종료하지 못함"
